        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Being a politician is an appropriate response to ideological concerns about socialism.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "There is moral urgency in preventing a repeat of Soviet-style economic collapse in the present-day U.S.",
