    "turn_idx": 64,
    "turn_text": "And it's terrible because physicians anymore are working either for the government or for insurance companies, not for you as a patient. So they cannot do, I'm sorry. That's the best for you, but it's not covered. So what can I do about it? I mean, it's terrible if that's happened with any other industry. And we kind of forgot, you know, we, our self-interest. drives in every organization or every human being. So when we said that somebody else is going to be responsible and have more interest than us than we are ourselves, we're kidding. We probably need to really make freedmen required, Milton freedmen required",
