    "turn_text": "Well, it's the best way is probably by email. You know, I have a great assistant too. So he's usually answer the phone and it's very bad. But you know, we're good. He's very good at that. But the best email is at senator.sparts, it's S-P-A-R-T-Z at I-G-A. .in.gov or you can just go to general. Just Google. In the general assembly and you find all of our names there with our emails. We all read our emails. We look. We're really close to people here. So the people can get to us very easily. We have town halls. We have a lot of meetings and we're going to have some still another health care committee meeting. It's going to be on October 30th. So feel free to stop by or watch it online too or email about it. We're always happy to hear about how we can do better because we serve the people and we spend your money so we better be responsible for results and a famous health scare. We need to have more results.",
